ate (boolean): visibility and workflow flags.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>actions (array): editorial actions already applied to this story. Each item has: name (e.g. "Featured Story", "Top Story", "Commentary", "Alert"), value (the assigned value; may be empty), valueLabel and valueType (how to interpret value). The presence of an item means that action has already been applied - do not confirm an action that is already applied.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>topics (array): event-of-the-day topics assigned to the story. Each item has: name, score (importance score), topicType ("Issues" or "Proactive").</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>tags (array): tags assigned to the story. Each item has: code (short unique code) and name.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>labels (array): key/value labels extracted or assigned.</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>tonePools (array): sentiment ratings for the story. Each item has: name (the rater/tone pool) and value (integer from -5 very negative to +5 very positive; 0 is neutral).</li><li data-list="bullet"><span class="ql-ui" contenteditable="false"></span>quotes (array): notable quotes extracted from the story. Each item has: statement (the quoted text) and byline (who said it).</li></ol><p><br></p><p>## News Story</p><p>Here is the news story you will review:</p><p>{content}</p>','content','14','true','admin','2026-07-23T04:23:36.560835+00:00','admin','2026-07-24T03:34:03.239351+00:00','2','Globe & Mail','','true','1','false',NULL,'false','true') ON CONFLICT (id) DO NOTHING;
